elected tool.\n\nRules:\n- Select only ONE tool.\n- The sub-goal must be directly achievable by the selected tool.\n- The Context section must contain all information the tool needs to function.\n- The response must end with the Context, Sub-Goal, and Tool Name sections in that order, with no extra content.\n                    ', 'gen_ai.response.id': 'chatcmpl-acf349ade21c41abaabb1e5dff957609', 'gen_ai.response.model': 'models/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct', 'gen_ai.usage.total_tokens': 1247, 'gen_ai.usage.prompt_tokens': 1084, 'gen_ai.usage.completion_tokens': 163, 'gen_ai.completion.0.finish_reason': 'stop', 'gen_ai.completion.0.role': 'assistant', 'gen_ai.completion.0.content': "1. **Justification:** The user has provided a mathematical problem that requires the application of Abel's theorem to determine the function \\( p(t) \\). Given that we already have a logical derivation using Abel's theorem and basic calculus, no specific mathematical or computational tool is required for this step. However, using the available `Generalist_Solution_Generator_Tool` as per the instructions allows us to generate a detailed solution following standard mathematical steps.\n\n2. **Context:** No additional context is needed beyond what has been previously provided.\n\n3. **Sub-Goal:** Generate a detailed solution for finding \\( p(t) \\) using Abel's theorem based on the given information.\n\n4. **Tool Name:** Generalist_Solution_Generator_Tool\n\n**Context**, **Sub-Goal**, and **Tool Name**:", 'prompt_token_ids': [151644, 8948, 198, 2610, 525, 264, 10950, 11, 11521, 11, 323, 7785, 17847, 13, 151645, 198, 151644, 872, 271, 6262, 25, 29901, 279, 22823, 1790, 3019, 311, 2621, 279, 3239, 1667, 2500, 7375, 323, 3681, 7354, 382, 1972, 510, 12, 3070, 2859, 66963, 16246, 279, 2086, 23810, 13482, 40164, 23606, 17767, 1124, 37018, 90, 67, 61, 17, 87, 15170, 8047, 61, 17, 92, 488, 281, 1155, 10699, 37018, 90, 12719, 15170, 8047, 92, 488, 2804, 1155, 50724, 284, 220, 15, 1124, 701, 1477, 279, 729,